WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.800
I stand up nights thinking, and wake up every
mornings checking my phone, measuring my life

00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:15.160
and self worth in quantifiable numbers, thinking
about all things I want to do, that I must

00:00:15.160 --> 00:00:17.730
do, always thinking about my next step

00:00:17.730 --> 00:00:18.730
wake up
work more,

00:00:18.730 --> 00:00:22.859
you are not good enough
sleep less, work faster

00:00:22.859 --> 00:00:25.290
work, go to sleep, wake up, do it all over
again

00:00:25.290 --> 00:00:29.519
one weeks passes, more coffee more cigarettes
more distractions from my thoughts from my

00:00:29.519 --> 00:00:32.270
emotions
there is always something that has to be done

00:00:32.270 --> 00:00:36.360
before I can offer myself the time to feel,
the time to accept myself

00:00:36.360 --> 00:00:39.780
I need to do more, sleep more , eat healthier,
exercise, be more social, work more, be better

00:00:39.780 --> 00:00:44.460
in every aspect of life, it s not enough,
will never be enough, don t stop, can t stop

00:00:44.460 --> 00:00:50.500
now, tomorrow will be better,
I need more and more of everything and only

00:00:50.500 --> 00:00:55.559
afterwards I will feel safe and accepted

00:00:55.559 --> 00:00:59.449
because how was I supposed to fill up the
emptiness inside of me, if not with achievements

00:00:59.449 --> 00:01:05.630
or with material objects
just one single problem, there was never enough,

00:01:05.630 --> 00:01:08.330
I was never satisfied

00:01:08.330 --> 00:01:12.729
I was aching, terror was filling my heart,
waking up stressed every morning

00:01:12.729 --> 00:01:18.360
a constant pressure everyday on being perfect,
I couldn t allow myself to be, I couldn t

00:01:18.360 --> 00:01:21.450
accept myself
I have created for myself the perfect trap

00:01:21.450 --> 00:01:22.790
of feeding my vicious beliefs

00:01:22.790 --> 00:01:28.119
A voice behind my back always whispering you
are not good enough, and you will never be

00:01:28.119 --> 00:01:31.549
never good enough to offer myself appreciation,
or compassion

00:01:31.549 --> 00:01:34.180
no empathy or understanding for my own being

00:01:34.180 --> 00:01:39.890
a submining behaviour in which I keep raising
the bar higher for myself, so I keep wanting

00:01:39.890 --> 00:01:43.659
more
a clear path to destruction, and I was aware

00:01:43.659 --> 00:01:44.659
of it

00:01:44.659 --> 00:01:49.140
a continuous roaming of the mind in its own
endless maze until it meets total collapse

00:01:49.140 --> 00:01:54.700
My own bubble of comfort whose walls used
to offer me safety, now were starting to constrain

00:01:54.700 --> 00:02:00.149
themself onto me,
slowly cutting my breath, making me feel insignificant,

00:02:00.149 --> 00:02:05.619
more and more day by day
Today It feels like the only safe space I

00:02:05.619 --> 00:02:09.619
have is my own room, but actually it s my
most dangerous trap created by comfort, and

00:02:09.619 --> 00:02:12.239
which will lead to my own destruction
so I am escaping,

00:02:12.239 --> 00:02:15.080
escaping the city I live in, escaping the
pattern which was spiraling me down into a

00:02:15.080 --> 00:02:19.140
deeper emotional numbing and less self awareness
of how I am neglecting myself and the people

00:02:19.140 --> 00:02:20.140
around me
until one day, I won t be able to wake up

00:02:20.140 --> 00:02:35.290
anymore, and I will be completely alone

00:02:35.290 --> 00:02:49.500
Chapter One Awareness
this is a story of anxiety and how workaholism

00:02:49.500 --> 00:02:53.120
is destroying my life,
a story of addiction many of us are living

00:02:53.120 --> 00:02:56.490
in one form or another, and how I started
to escape workaholism

00:02:56.490 --> 00:03:02.690
In this short movie I want to open up a little,
to explore and present my addiction, which

00:03:02.690 --> 00:03:07.750
is workaholism, while showcasing some shots
from my trip to bucharest using the Sony Film

00:03:07.750 --> 00:03:11.810
Simulation Picture Profiles
If you are not familiar with sony film simulations,

00:03:11.810 --> 00:03:15.580
They are in camera picture profiles meant
to give you great color Straight out of camera

00:03:15.580 --> 00:03:20.110
for both video and photo modes and I have
a full playlist on this subject, so you can

00:03:20.110 --> 00:03:24.129
go check it out on my channel

00:03:24.129 --> 00:03:29.730
I just purchased the sigma 24 f2 contemporary
which is an absolute beauty and wanted to

00:03:29.730 --> 00:03:34.330
test it in a more lively context compared
to my hometown, which is a very quiet place.

00:03:34.330 --> 00:03:38.530
So I decided I needed something new, a new
environment to push me out of my comfort zone,

00:03:38.530 --> 00:03:43.159
out of my room out of my apartment, to see
everything with a new perspective

00:03:43.159 --> 00:03:47.849
something to fix me in the moment
and what better place than a capital city?

00:03:47.849 --> 00:03:49.050
So I planned my trip to bucharest

00:03:49.050 --> 00:03:56.500
Woke up after sleeping 12 hours in the chair.
Got off the train half asleep everything seemed

00:03:56.500 --> 00:04:01.659
like moving slowly &amp; fast, in the same time.
Sun was rising rapidly without patience and

00:04:01.659 --> 00:04:05.860
people were hurrying up to find their place,
so I anxiously followed the flow and started

00:04:05.860 --> 00:04:09.060
searching for the first moment to capture.

00:04:09.060 --> 00:04:21.690
I had multiple film simulation that I wanted
to showcase in this video, like the kodachrome

00:04:21.690 --> 00:04:25.800
64
ektar100, and cinestill50D, senova light,

00:04:25.800 --> 00:04:30.390
kodak gold and cinechrome, but after trying
out the new cinechrome film simulation I just

00:04:30.390 --> 00:04:32.890
fell in love with with it and I sticked with
it most of the time

00:04:32.890 --> 00:04:36.759
I ll put the name of the film simulations
used under each shot so you can decide for

00:04:36.759 --> 00:04:39.080
yourself which one is your favorite

00:04:39.080 --> 00:04:42.940
The footage was all graded using my film power
grades which you can find on my website, but

00:04:42.940 --> 00:04:48.139
the photos are straight out of camera to showcase
the colors and image you can get without editing

00:04:48.139 --> 00:04:52.570
just by using these sony film simulations.

00:04:52.570 --> 00:05:00.940
Chapter 2 Angst

00:05:00.940 --> 00:05:05.300
I had all these film simulations and I didn
t know which one to start with, I felt overwhelmed

00:05:05.300 --> 00:05:10.570
trying to decide which should best fit the
situation? Or atleast mirror my own mood?

00:05:10.570 --> 00:05:16.949
But what was my mood? What was I feeling,
I actually didn t know because everything

00:05:16.949 --> 00:05:19.580
was masked by a feeling of overwhelmedness

00:05:19.580 --> 00:05:24.259
it s morning people are in action, the sun
is low creating interesting shapes to work

00:05:24.259 --> 00:05:28.770
with, and as I was walking I took a couple
shots in my frenetic desperation to capture

00:05:28.770 --> 00:05:47.600
something, but it all felt off,
but couldn t focus and i ve lost so many moments,

00:05:47.600 --> 00:05:50.380
So I panicked
I felt like between two walls which seemed

00:05:50.380 --> 00:05:54.289
to get closer to each other in an alarming
state.

00:05:54.289 --> 00:05:58.810
I was supposed to come together with 2 friends,
but they canceled, so I ended up alone, which

00:05:58.810 --> 00:06:07.740
made me even more anxious, paralyzed, I couldn
t gather the courage to go out alone.

00:06:07.740 --> 00:06:12.760
I was in a ruth, doing the same things everyday,
unconsciously engaging in the same unhealthy

00:06:12.760 --> 00:06:30.720
behaviors, ignoring the signs my body or my
mind were giving me

00:06:30.720 --> 00:06:34.910
I was living just like a mindless robot,
even tho I am still young, i ve Never felt

00:06:34.910 --> 00:06:40.330
as old and helpless as I did in this moment
I couldn t control my life, I had no energy

00:06:40.330 --> 00:06:45.509
to take the responsibility for my own decisions,
so I was piloting this body on auto mode,

00:06:45.509 --> 00:06:50.979
I was living inside an illusion, hoping things
will get better without me trying

00:06:50.979 --> 00:06:54.280
it is so stupidly simple
something I used to do which such ease in

00:06:54.280 --> 00:06:57.690
the past, now seems like a huge wall which
is impossible to be climbed

00:06:57.690 --> 00:07:22.180
I am not even capable of leaving my home to
exercise in the park or to take a walk, what

00:07:22.180 --> 00:07:25.729
about leaving home to visit another city all
by myself?

00:07:25.729 --> 00:07:30.790
This was a bad idea
Why am I feeling like this? It shouldn t be

00:07:30.790 --> 00:07:35.950
such a big deal, i ve done this so many times
in the past, why is it so hard right now?

00:07:35.950 --> 00:07:41.870
I feel lethargic and I feel shame, I feel
like a failure, like I will end up being nobody,

00:07:41.870 --> 00:07:46.610
because I keep feeling more and more anxious,
more overwhelmed of life and all the changes

00:07:46.610 --> 00:08:12.120
going on these days.
I do not feel safe in my own home, I cannot

00:08:12.120 --> 00:08:17.419
feel safe around my closest friends, I can
barely feel safe with myself alone, and that

00:08:17.419 --> 00:08:20.900
for how long?
How long till I won t be able to handle myself

00:08:20.900 --> 00:08:21.900
either?

00:08:21.900 --> 00:08:27.009
Well, you know what, I am done feeling bad,
i m reframing my life to a new direction

00:08:27.009 --> 00:08:31.990
I am stil scared as hell, but I choose to
go, I choose to jump into the endless pit

00:08:31.990 --> 00:08:32.990
of anxiety

00:08:32.990 --> 00:08:41.000
Chapter 3 Letting go

00:08:41.000 --> 00:08:45.610
As the rush hour was on a decline, there were
less and less people on the streets,and the

00:08:45.610 --> 00:08:50.970
sun was rising menacingly
It already seems pretty bad, I just got there

00:08:50.970 --> 00:08:56.140
but already felt like I am behind schedule.
there was not much to do, it felt like a bad

00:08:56.140 --> 00:08:59.260
start of a day, but I didn t want to quit.

00:08:59.260 --> 00:09:04.290
Suddenly a voice in my head stopped me and
reminded me why I was there.

00:09:04.290 --> 00:09:09.900
I came to relax, I came to experiment, there
is no final destination to reach, there are

00:09:09.900 --> 00:09:15.520
no goals to achieve. There is only me and
time. Time to explore.

00:09:15.520 --> 00:09:19.769
So I dialed in the settings for Cinechrome
which was never tested before on the field

00:09:19.769 --> 00:09:22.200
and I just started to give myself a moment

00:09:22.200 --> 00:09:37.600
I 

00:09:37.600 --> 00:09:41.230
slowly calmed down and started to feel the
city

00:09:41.230 --> 00:09:46.110
Everything started to slowly fall into place

00:09:46.110 --> 00:09:51.440
slowly everybody refuged in their own affairs
most of them working, some starting to find

00:09:51.440 --> 00:09:56.690
shelter from the burning sun which was looking
more and more menacing as it was rising up

00:09:56.690 --> 00:10:02.380
over the endless concrete jungle..
So I was wondering where can I find people

00:10:02.380 --> 00:10:05.980
and stories at this late hour?

00:10:05.980 --> 00:10:11.760
I just walked around, taking shots of buildings,
waiting for something unique to happen, something

00:10:11.760 --> 00:10:35.280
out of the ordinary.

00:10:35.280 --> 00:10:39.709
People say bucharest is a concrete jungle,
and it s true, but I was amazed to see how

00:10:39.709 --> 00:10:43.080
many parks and green spots they had.

00:10:43.080 --> 00:10:48.089
Every street was filled with trees, and every
zone had atleast 1 huge park.

00:10:48.089 --> 00:10:52.440
I started losing track of my map, I just swirled
around being attentive to everything happening

00:10:52.440 --> 00:10:53.959
around me,

00:10:53.959 --> 00:10:56.601
and suddenly it came to me
it just clicked, my anxiety melted and I was

00:10:56.601 --> 00:11:14.459
in touch with my surroundings,

00:11:14.459 --> 00:11:20.579
I just realized one of my most valuable lessons
for street photography up to this moment,which

00:11:20.579 --> 00:11:26.120
is in street photography, just like life in
general, is not about always moving around,

00:11:26.120 --> 00:11:29.690
hunting frenetically for the next moment,
the next hype.

00:11:29.690 --> 00:11:35.360
sometimes is a calling for meditation, for
being still, in the moment, in the same spot,

00:11:35.360 --> 00:11:40.000
and without realizing, the beauty of life
unwraps before you.

00:11:40.000 --> 00:11:41.910
Chapter 4
Take a Moment

00:11:41.910 --> 00:11:47.700
There is a certain charm to this city, to
the streets, the people. Everybody is open

00:11:47.700 --> 00:11:53.410
and so friendly.
Coming from a small town, where people look

00:11:53.410 --> 00:11:58.300
oddly uncertain at you if you have a camera
around your neck, bucharest was a lovely invitation

00:11:58.300 --> 00:12:02.640
to playfulness.
How the lights fall onto the street, the architecture,

00:12:02.640 --> 00:12:07.339
the shops the smile of the people when they
realize you took their shot. There is a certain

00:12:07.339 --> 00:12:11.760
magic to this city, and They all seemed so
be enjoying being part of the process. As

00:12:11.760 --> 00:12:16.160
much as I did
it s my second time visiting bucharest, and

00:12:16.160 --> 00:12:29.730
I absolutely love it

00:12:29.730 --> 00:12:34.400
Unfortunately I won t use too many pictures
with recognizable people because I don t want

00:12:34.400 --> 00:12:38.620
anyone to be offended. I tried to ask most
people if they mind if I took their picture,

00:12:38.620 --> 00:12:44.600
but I never asked them if they d like to appear
in my video, so to respect their identity

00:12:44.600 --> 00:13:01.880
I will post only pictures of unrecognizable
people

00:13:01.880 --> 00:14:07.399
Shortly I realized I was enjoying myself and
started shooting absolute random nothingness.

00:14:07.399 --> 00:14:11.550
After walking around in circles for a couple
hours, I came to the conclusion that it s

00:14:11.550 --> 00:14:12.699
time to move to another zone

00:14:12.699 --> 00:14:39.959
Chapter 5 Stillness
the sun is high and strong so I shelter in

00:14:39.959 --> 00:14:50.120
one of my favorite parks
everything starts to move slowly and gentle,

00:14:50.120 --> 00:14:54.910
time feels like taking a break as well in
this sunny day and everything starts to feel

00:14:54.910 --> 00:15:16.600
a little bit more colorful in my eyes

00:15:16.600 --> 00:15:21.960
I just walked around, observing
birds chirping, people were relaxing in the

00:15:21.960 --> 00:15:24.140
shade, some were sunbathing and kids were
playing

00:15:24.140 --> 00:15:30.980
it was a very calm place to be

00:15:30.980 --> 00:15:50.199
I really love these shots, seeing these kids
playing reminded me very much of my childhood

00:15:50.199 --> 00:15:53.130
and how I used to play in the summer time
with sticks or pretty much anything I could

00:15:53.130 --> 00:16:04.410
find

00:16:04.410 --> 00:16:09.660
everything felt different in those times,no
worries on my mind, everything seemed to move

00:16:09.660 --> 00:16:14.920
slow and my heart was filled with curiosity
to explore, nowadays it s hard to reconnect

00:16:14.920 --> 00:16:23.430
or feel the same
but 

00:16:23.430 --> 00:16:52.339
even tho I am different, maybe it s time to
reconnect

00:16:52.339 --> 00:16:56.000
after a quiet and relaxing stroll through
the park I decide it s time to explore new

00:16:56.000 --> 00:16:57.000
areas

00:16:57.000 --> 00:17:03.070
There is something about public transportation
that really makes me feel excited, especially

00:17:03.070 --> 00:17:09.610
the subway
Maybe it s the lights, the changing levels

00:17:09.610 --> 00:17:17.880
of underground, maybe how the wind is blowing
like the storm is coming, the smell of basement,

00:17:17.880 --> 00:17:37.280
and the stories, I just love it all
probably no place holds as many stories as

00:17:37.280 --> 00:17:39.010
the subway,
they ve seen it all

00:17:39.010 --> 00:17:44.049
when you were rushing late in the morning,
when you were having a good laugh being drunk

00:17:44.049 --> 00:17:49.620
with your friends, when you smirked because
you received a text from somebody special,

00:17:49.620 --> 00:17:54.610
And also when you were alone, and you held
inside the tears because there was nobody

00:17:54.610 --> 00:17:56.880
to hold you
it s all in the subway

00:17:56.880 --> 00:18:03.230
I love observing and taking part of stories,
it s where most inspirations takes form

00:18:03.230 --> 00:18:09.350
A place where you can start to feel and understand,
that we are all people, fragile and vulnerable

00:18:09.350 --> 00:18:13.280
human beings.
and sometimes that s all we need, someone

00:18:13.280 --> 00:18:17.950
to listen and to understand us
but instead we are taught how to be strong

00:18:17.950 --> 00:18:24.919
individuals, how to be heartless, how to ignore
our emotions &amp; leave our human traits behind,

00:18:24.919 --> 00:18:28.650
because it only shows weakness
We need to be helped, not pushed down

00:18:28.650 --> 00:18:57.660
CHAPTER 6 Connection

00:18:57.660 --> 00:19:31.900
at this point I was shooting mindlessly, it
was such an easy pleasure, walking around

00:19:31.900 --> 00:19:38.049
everything seemed of interest to me, not regretting
at all knowing that I was going to spend hours

00:19:38.049 --> 00:19:53.910
deleting the useless shots i've taken
I felt so free with all my worries melted,

00:19:53.910 --> 00:19:58.299
everything seemed so real and in place, just
like it s supposed to be

00:19:58.299 --> 00:20:02.809
I was seeing something unique on every street,
and it was the first time I felt so inspired

00:20:02.809 --> 00:20:07.270
in so long
I wasn't just a ball of anxiety anymore, my

00:20:07.270 --> 00:20:10.870
mind wasn't overreacting and overthinking
everything

00:20:10.870 --> 00:20:21.840
it was stillness 

00:20:21.840 --> 00:20:25.789
and finally I felt connected to my inner self

00:20:25.789 --> 00:20:31.610
coming here alone was not a mistake, and it
was not by chance

00:20:31.610 --> 00:20:46.600
it was all part of my journey of reconnecting
it was my liberation.

00:20:46.600 --> 00:21:17.919
Chapter 7 Uncertainty
as the sun goes down, the ambiance of the

00:21:17.919 --> 00:21:21.409
city changes as well,
People starting to be less friendly, and more

00:21:21.409 --> 00:21:25.720
skeptical of any interactions, especially
in the areas that I wanted to explore, which

00:21:25.720 --> 00:21:44.919
were pretty dangerous night time
I myself, became more aware of what is going

00:21:44.919 --> 00:21:50.470
on around me, since the ambiance changes from
block to block, and suddenly sketchy folks

00:21:50.470 --> 00:21:55.550
started to appear on the streets.
one street can be peaceful with pretty houses,

00:21:55.550 --> 00:21:59.310
while the next one full shady people roaming
around.

00:21:59.310 --> 00:22:04.460
overall I it felt great revisiting bucharest
and this trip was exactly what I needed, but

00:22:04.460 --> 00:22:09.470
with empty streets and nothing going on, it
s slowly getting boring, and it felt like

00:22:09.470 --> 00:22:13.480
it s time to go home
But one funny thing is, I wanted this trip

00:22:13.480 --> 00:22:18.059
to be as spontaneous as possible, so I decided
last minute to leave, and didn't check what

00:22:18.059 --> 00:22:25.980
time is the train returning hometown
usually there are trains every couple hours,

00:22:25.980 --> 00:22:30.460
so didn't take into consideration my next
train will leave only the following day at

00:22:30.460 --> 00:22:33.940
6 am

00:22:33.940 --> 00:22:37.980
it was around 11:30 pm and overall i've been
walking 18 hours straight

00:22:37.980 --> 00:22:43.270
I was really tired, my body was aching for
sleep and I still had more than 6 hours to

00:22:43.270 --> 00:22:46.010
wait till I could leave bucharest
there were no rides or other transportation

00:22:46.010 --> 00:22:49.700
i could take to my hometown at that late hour.
So to speed up the remaining time I went back

00:22:49.700 --> 00:23:13.150
on the streets,

00:23:13.150 --> 00:23:52.450
but out of the sudden, everything changed
completely and got really creepy,

00:23:52.450 --> 00:23:57.100
couple hour passes by shooting mindlessly,
listening to the streets, being aware of every

00:23:57.100 --> 00:24:01.500
sound happening around me,
But with streets being completely desolated

00:24:01.500 --> 00:24:06.400
and at times weird people appearing from nowhere,
I didn't feel that comfortable anymore walking

00:24:06.400 --> 00:25:10.539
all by myself

00:25:10.539 --> 00:25:15.190
the subway was also closing so I had to take
my final ride for the night

00:25:15.190 --> 00:25:19.919
I wasn't aware of this aspect either, I thought
I will be able to travel with the subway all

00:25:19.919 --> 00:25:28.809
night
Unfortunately the last stop was not exactly

00:25:28.809 --> 00:25:32.440
at the train station,
I was in a rather dangerous part of the city

00:25:32.440 --> 00:25:36.870
at around 1-2am, and I had to go by foot all
the way back to the train station

00:25:36.870 --> 00:25:41.900
Chapter 8 Reflection

00:25:41.900 --> 00:25:45.630
coming out of the subway, I notice people
whispering in distance and groups of people

00:25:45.630 --> 00:25:51.490
rapidly disappearing behind corners. It was
all pretty sketchy

00:25:51.490 --> 00:25:56.090
Suddenly 2 guys appeared, riding their bikes
strangely close to me,

00:25:56.090 --> 00:25:59.470
everything seemed rather uneasy and I was
very cautious of my surroundings

00:25:59.470 --> 00:26:04.961
it was all so silent
there was nobody on the street, only some

00:26:04.961 --> 00:26:17.100
cars passing by

00:26:17.100 --> 00:26:21.570
there was no restaurant or fast food open,
no place to waste my time in safety until

00:26:21.570 --> 00:26:28.700
the morning comes.I eventually decided it
would be safest to go back at the train station

00:26:28.700 --> 00:26:48.659
and wait for the morning to come

00:26:48.659 --> 00:26:53.190
So walked back to the station and waited there,
together with a couple people who were also

00:26:53.190 --> 00:26:57.580
commuting to Bucharest from smaller cities,
they were also waiting for the the night to

00:26:57.580 --> 00:27:05.080
end
I spoke to one guy, he was such a kind soul

00:27:05.080 --> 00:27:08.929
but very unfortunate
for the last 3 years he has been working without

00:27:08.929 --> 00:27:12.059
any contract in Bucharest, as a daily worker

00:27:12.059 --> 00:27:15.820
business owners come pick him up together
with other job seekers and they promise them

00:27:15.820 --> 00:27:20.980
work for a day, sometimes 1 week or if you
re lucky 1 month,

00:27:20.980 --> 00:27:26.140
But many times he finds no work for weeks,
so he stays in the strain station, homeless,

00:27:26.140 --> 00:27:29.049
because he has nothing better to do in his
small town

00:27:29.049 --> 00:27:33.289
he believes he has no other way of earning
money, and he will never find a good job because

00:27:33.289 --> 00:27:37.350
people won t hire him.
He wasn't sure if he should stay one more

00:27:37.350 --> 00:27:43.490
day or not, he had 5 bucks left, that was
all his money, which was his train ticket

00:27:43.490 --> 00:27:46.260
money.
He didn't beg for money, he wasn't trying

00:27:46.260 --> 00:27:50.990
to use his story for me to pity him
I could see the sorrow, the honesty and the

00:27:50.990 --> 00:27:54.190
true soul of this man
I approached him and he just opened up to

00:27:54.190 --> 00:27:56.610
me, which I appreciated

00:27:56.610 --> 00:28:00.529
he deserved more, but he couldn't see the
opportunities he could have

00:28:00.529 --> 00:28:05.830
his story really touched me, so after I gave
him some food money and my goodbyes, I started

00:28:05.830 --> 00:28:10.090
reflecting on how much do we need to loose
in this life to realize of what we had in

00:28:10.090 --> 00:28:14.149
front of us?
His story made me realize how ungrateful I

00:28:14.149 --> 00:28:19.360
can be at times, and how much luck I had in
comparison to others to have the life of mine,

00:28:19.360 --> 00:28:24.399
or at least for the chance to be aware, to
be able to choose new perspectives. Just because

00:28:24.399 --> 00:28:31.140
I knew I had a choice and a chance for a better
life, the luck of having hope to change things,

00:28:31.140 --> 00:28:36.279
hope which this man had no more.
it s not much, but even this little awareness

00:28:36.279 --> 00:28:40.620
is a such a privilege.
it s never our job to judge and bring people

00:28:40.620 --> 00:28:44.890
down, but try to help them be their best,
little by little.

00:28:44.890 --> 00:28:48.399
Because that s why we become addicted,
and ill minded,

00:28:48.399 --> 00:28:50.460
and angry,
and mad,

00:28:50.460 --> 00:28:54.470
because we cannot relate to one another.
Because we feel so misunderstood

00:28:54.470 --> 00:28:59.020
because we feel like we don t belong
because we cannot stand each other.

00:28:59.020 --> 00:29:04.809
But what if we just stopped for a second and
listened to the ones close to us

00:29:04.809 --> 00:29:09.870
realize we are all humans, we are not perfect,
we ll make so many mistakes

00:29:09.870 --> 00:29:14.809
And that is part of the process, so instead
of separation and hate, let s try to understand

00:29:14.809 --> 00:29:18.350
each other
because that is all we seek as humans, we

00:29:18.350 --> 00:29:22.669
seek appreciation through various forms,
isn't compassion our most powerful tool in

00:29:22.669 --> 00:29:26.130
resolving problems and overcoming our own
ego?

00:29:26.130 --> 00:29:29.399
Compassion towards our self
towards the ones around us

00:29:29.399 --> 00:29:32.490
understanding which fulfills the emptiness
our trauma left behind,

00:29:32.490 --> 00:29:38.029
more than achievements, more than cars, and
rings, clothes and material objects.

00:29:38.029 --> 00:29:42.860
only if we allow our self to be vulnerable
and a new perspective arises

00:29:42.860 --> 00:29:47.919
a new world is built right in front of us
a world of humanity and connection

00:29:47.919 --> 00:29:52.440
a world where we make mistakes, but a world
where we also fix what we've broken

00:29:52.440 --> 00:29:59.760
and a place to exist with all our differences
for everybody to be together, in community

00:29:59.760 --> 00:30:01.640
hopefully this video helped you see a new
perspective

00:30:01.640 --> 00:30:04.540
And Thank you for watching!

